WEBVTT

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:07.600
And then...

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:09.970
N-No way...

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.630
That card...?

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.420
Yes way, indeed.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.000
A second Pegasus Knight?!

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.440
Like I said...

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:26.480
I'm going to beat you with this card.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:39.300
Why?!

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.830
Why can I see him?!

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:46.880
Now, picture this...

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:51.900
You, defeated before an overwhelming power...

00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:59.710
Aichi... I was right...

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:02.030
Aichi...

00:02:34.570 --> 00:02:37.690
Picture myself losing?!

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.820
H-Hey...

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:43.010
Yeah...

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.120
He's just like Ren...

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:52.980
Psyqualia

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:56.940
Alfred's Counterblast!

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:00.750
Come, Margal!

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:08.950
Yes! Now the Royal Paladins 
are all assembled!

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:11.750
That brings out Alfred's full power!

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:23.010
I attack Black Panther with 
Palamedes, boosted by Marron!

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:25.540
I activate Palamedes's skill!

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:27.260
He gets +3000 power!

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:31.030
21000...

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:33.040
Shoot... No guard!

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.280
Damage trigger check!

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:41.830
Here I go.

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:44.360
I attack Black Panther!

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:50.020
Twin drive...

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:58.810
Yes!

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:00.910
That's 4 damage!

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:02.080
He's caught up!

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:06.960
Then, with a boost from Pegasus Knight...

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:08.560
Gallatin attacks!

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:13.850
Pegasus Knight!

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:19.070
No matter what, I can't let 
this attack get through!

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:21.440
I guard with Silence Joker!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.490
My turn is over.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:37.720
Trying to intimidate me, huh?

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:41.990
I don't know what he intends to 
do with that Pegasus Knight...

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:44.870
but if I can end the fight 
this turn, it doesn't matter!

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:47.530
His damage is 4...

00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:51.860
And my hand is more than up to 
the task of dealing out 2 damage.

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:55.940
I'm gonna win... I'm gonna win!

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:59.700
The Great Kyou rides General Seifried!

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:06.630
What, again?!

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:07.690
WA, yo?!

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:10.870
I told you, "the Great rides" is mine!

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:13.100
Enough about that...

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:16.870
I call Highspeed, Brakki!

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:19.110
Mecha Trainer exits the field.

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:20.620
With a boost from Assault Squad...

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:22.550
Brakki attacks!

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:26.030
Brakki's Soulblast!

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:29.790
I add +5000 to the power of Brakki!

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:35.010
No guard.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:39.040
Damage trigger check.

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:43.440
He's got 5 damage!

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:48.480
Brother...

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:55.800
After Brakki's Soulblast and 
attack, he returns to the deck.

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:59.580
I use Assault Squad's skill to stand it up.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:05.090
Now, I'm sure you'll put up useless 
resistance to try and stop this being the end, right?

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:09.650
Unfriendly jerk...

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:13.790
I attack with Seifried, 
boosted by Dudley Dan!

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:16.910
I activate Seifried's skill!

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:18.810
+3000 power!

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:21.800
And on top of that, Dudley 
Dan's Counterblast!

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:28.200
I Superior Call Wonder Boy from my deck!

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:31.990
Seifried...

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.660
General Blast!

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:46.590
I guard with Epona and 
High Dog Breeder, Akane!

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:50.860
The total is 25000...

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:54.300
Seyfried's power is 17000...

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:57.570
If he draws two triggers in the twin drive...

00:06:57.570 --> 00:06:59.530
...his attack will get through.

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:04.540
It could go either way, but how is Aichi 
Sendou going to keep what he has in his hand?

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:06.120
Good question.

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:09.070
Kyou still has units standing.

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:13.030
He can't afford to use up all 
the cards in his hand here...

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.630
It's a tense moment, isn't it?

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:15.870
<i>Oh</i>, indeed it is!

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:20.070
If Aichi can get through this, Kyou 
has just one more attack left...

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:21.800
Stay away, trigger!

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:24.030
Drive trigger check!

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:26.280
No trigger!

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:28.410
We're not out of the woods yet...

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:33.520
For General Seifried's drive check,

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:36.140
if a grade 3 Spike Brothers is drawn,

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:38.710
that unit can be called!

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:51.730
Now I can attack twice more!

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:54.900
What's wrong?

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:57.750
So scared you can't even talk?

00:07:57.750 --> 00:07:59.720
No, I'm okay.

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:02.150
Please, do your second check.

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:03.550
Fine!

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:05.170
Second check!

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:16.720
He's got two attacks left...

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.350
And Aichi has only two cards in his hand...

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:22.100
Whatever you do, please 
protect yourself, Brother!

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:26.450
My attack will soon put 
you out of your misery!

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:27.060
Here I go!

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:29.790
I'll start with my Sky Diver on the right!

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:32.210
He attacks with a boost from Wonder Boy!

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:35.030
I guard with Elaine!

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:43.280
So you had a card you could use, huh?!

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:45.920
But what about your last card?

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.900
This time, the Sky Diver on my left!

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:50.230
He attacks with a boost from Assault Squad!

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:52.300
I guard with Pongal!

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:55.840
That's not enough to protect 
against this attack!

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:58.420
Not only that, you've used up your hand!

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:01.440
Gallatin! Come forward!

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.190
Intercept?!

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:13.860
He did it!

00:09:14.270 --> 00:09:15.970
He protected himself!

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:19.570
You did it, Brother!

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:21.280
Rats!

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:25.970
I've attacked four times 
but only done 1 damage?!

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:32.940
He doesn't have a unit in the front row...

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:34.660
That means, on his next turn...

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:37.050
he'll bring that Pegasus Knight forward?!

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:39.190
Is your turn over?

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:41.550
Y-Yeah...

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:42.920
In that case...

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:45.230
Final Turn!

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:47.820
W-What?!

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.360
Brother said...

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.800
"Final Turn"?!

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:57.850
This has gotten interesting!

00:09:58.360 --> 00:09:59.500
That boy...

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:26.270
"Final Turn", you say?!

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:28.980
You trying to make a fool out of me?!

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:31.150
I don't have to try.

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:33.650
You already are one.

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:36.400
Messing with me?!

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:39.040
H-Hey... Isn't that...

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:40.840
Yeah. He's in trouble.

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:45.110
That's exactly what Ren would do.

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:47.620
I move Pegasus Knight...

00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:51.070
and then call Marron to the open spot!

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:53.570
I activate Margal's skill!

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:55.660
By moving Margal to the Soul,

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:58.700
I give Pegasus Knight +3000 power!

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:02.570
Then, through Pegasus Knight's own skill,

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:04.300
he gains another +3000 power!

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:06.100
Blast it!

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:07.600
He's making a fool out of me!

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:10.230
Is he really gonna win this 
fight with that card?!

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:14.230
I attack Seifried with a boost from Marron!

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:18.930
Wait a second!

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:21.850
I thought you were gonna <i>finish 
me off</i> with Pegasus Knight?

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:24.420
I still have only 4 damage.

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:28.080
If your attack succeeds, 
that puts me at 5 damage.

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:31.230
Are you going to guard? Or not?

00:11:32.030 --> 00:11:33.450
No guard!

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:40.670
Damage trigger check!

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:44.330
I got a draw trigger!

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:46.600
I add +5000 to the power of Seifried!

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:47.890
And then I draw!

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:50.140
All right!

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:53.400
Now I've got two perfect defenses!

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:58.820
Sorry to spoil the much-anticipated Pegasus 
Knight attack, but I see what's going to happen.

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:01.100
Let me make a prediction now:

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:03.490
You're not gonna win!

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:08.990
It's just as I told you. 
This is the Final Turn.

00:12:11.490 --> 00:12:12.510
Here I go!

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:20.130
I guard with Cheer Girl, Tiara!

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:24.230
Twin drive...

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:28.540
Got it! Stand trigger!

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:31.070
What?!

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:34.130
Pegasus Knight stands.

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:36.740
And I add +5000 to his power!

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:40.110
I-It can't be...

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:42.620
Hey! That's...

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:44.390
Seriously, the same as Ren?!

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:55.910
Next.

00:12:56.600 --> 00:13:00.550
I attack with Swordsman of the Explosive 
Flames, Palamedes, boosted by Marron!

00:13:00.970 --> 00:13:06.260
During an attack, Flame Swordsman can use 
his own ability to increase his power by +3000!

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:11.520
His power is 21000?!

00:13:12.050 --> 00:13:13.730
I've gotta do it...

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:17.900
I put one card from my hand into the Drop 
Zone! Marilyn gives me perfect defense!

00:13:20.130 --> 00:13:23.170
It seems Pegasus Knight is ready...

00:13:23.960 --> 00:13:26.120
Now, picture this...

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:29.510
You, sprawling on the ground 
of the planet Cray...

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:35.330
W-Where am I?!

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:39.110
What is this?!

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:42.690
That power...

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.130
There's no mistaking it.

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:46.380
Psyqualia...

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:48.840
Hey! What's going on?!

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:53.100
A-Anyway, it went just like Aichi said!

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:55.130
Aichi...

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:03.070
P-Pegasus Knight!

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:06.280
I-I don't have a hand!

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:08.100
I can't guard...

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:15.420
It's... It's not over!

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:19.220
My revenge won't end here!

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:22.130
I can't let it end!

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:26.050
If I can just draw a heal trigger here...!

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:34.560
I don't... believe it...

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:41.940
What the heck is this?

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:47.750
What's his name again? Aichi Sendou...?

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:53.160
I lost...

00:14:58.870 --> 00:14:59.890
Kyou!

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:01.080
What's wrong?!

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:01.790
Hey! Kyou!

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:02.180
Hey!

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:03.280
Pull yourself together!

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:15.680
Aichi... Is that really Aichi?

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:20.940
Th-The winner is Aichi Sendou from Team Q4!

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:28.420
I won, Kai.

00:15:36.220 --> 00:15:37.620
Aichi!

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:39.870
Aichi!

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:41.950
Are you all right, Brother?!

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:42.860
Y-Yeah...

00:15:43.220 --> 00:15:45.350
Huh? That's strange...

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:47.400
Huh?

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:53.000
I can hardly believe it! <i>That</i> boy?

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:57.510
It was no coincidence that he came to Psy.

00:15:57.510 --> 00:16:00.390
Right. That was fate.

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:04.170
Huh? You look kind of happy about it, Kourin.

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:09.160
W-What?! I'm allowed to be pleased when a 
person with the power is found, aren't I?

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:12.470
Hmm... Is that really all there is to it?

00:16:12.470 --> 00:16:13.740
Of course!

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:16.730
Wow, what a surprise!

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:20.730
Aichi Sendou of Team Q4 is 
both a prophet and a fighter!

00:16:20.730 --> 00:16:23.230
Just like in a professional shogi 
players' championship series...

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:28.470
Mmm, I'd love to try a fight where I 
could read my opponent's next two moves.

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:31.000
It certainly was a wonderful fight!

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:36.750
Of course... My fights are number one...

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:39.000
What the heck happened out there?!

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:44.480
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:51.660
Sounds like Misaki's fight has started...

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:53.350
Yep...

00:16:53.350 --> 00:16:56.190
But more importantly, Aichi, are you okay?

00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:58.030
You don't need to worry about me.

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:00.490
Putting me in this infirmary 
was overreacting.

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:03.250
Aichi, today, you...

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:08.620
You were scary.

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:12.950
Really? I was just fighting like normal...

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:16.860
Sorry... I'm going to get a drink.

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:18.220
Sure...

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:20.720
Scary?

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:22.590
What does she mean?

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:31.590
Hey, so what about this girl? 
She's pretty impressive, right?

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:34.190
True. She does have an amazing memory.

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:37.680
And she's been using that ability 
more often in her fights.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.120
Yeah, right?!

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:40.340
Then...

00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:41.070
No.

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:44.900
I can't sense the Psyqualia from her.

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:48.070
I had my hopes up, but...

00:17:48.070 --> 00:17:49.190
It's too bad.

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:51.870
Shoot. Oh, well...

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:54.170
At least we've found one more today.

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:55.310
Exactly.

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:09.240
The winner is Misaki Tokura from Team Q4!

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:17.620
What are those voices?

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:20.000
Tokura won.

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:22.530
Kai!

00:18:23.470 --> 00:18:25.980
Then we won, right?!

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:26.540
Yeah...

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:29.610
I see. We...

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:31.290
Kai!

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:32.670
What?

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:35.760
I've gotten stronger, haven't I?

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:42.080
Since meeting you again 
and starting Vanguard,

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:44.720
I've had all kinds of fights.

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:48.020
But I've never felt it like I did today...

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.630
That I'm strong...

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:52.870
No, Aichi Sendou.

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:55.230
You've become weaker.

00:18:57.590 --> 00:19:00.490
Everyone in Team Q4,

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:02.500
congratulations!

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:03.560
Banzai!

00:19:04.680 --> 00:19:05.970
You did it!

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:10.440
Here.

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:17.300
Darn it... Can't count on anyone...

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:18.420
What do we do now?

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:21.370
Is this the end of our revenge?

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:23.930
What are you blabbering about?!

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:26.780
This isn't the only regional tournament!

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:29.770
All we have to do is win another tournament, 
and then we can go to nationals!

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:32.500
And then I'll get my revenge!

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:36.830
Against Ren Suzugamori! And Toshiki 
Kai! And Aichi Sendou, too!

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:39.260
Dude...

00:19:39.260 --> 00:19:40.840
There's just no way...

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:42.050
What a poor sport.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:44.650
Who are you people?!

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:46.250
Brilliant Stars!

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:47.120
What are you doing here?!

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:52.420
We heard a rumor that a pathetic 
loser was scheming something.

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:55.540
And so we came to put an end to it.

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:58.580
You three should've just quietly disappeared.

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:04.460
Only beautiful things 
can exist in this world.

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:11.340
Kai...

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:13.300
What did you just say?

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:16.310
You've gotten weaker.

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:18.220
Why?!

00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:20.560
I beat that Kyou guy!

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:22.330
But you...

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:24.200
You tell me...

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:28.940
If that's what you think, then fight me!

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:32.010
I'll make you understand 
just how strong I've gotten!

00:20:45.900 --> 00:20:47.260
What's wrong?

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:51.570
Are you afraid of losing to me?

00:20:54.990 --> 00:20:56.140
Miss Emi?!

00:20:56.850 --> 00:20:59.080
What are you doing here?

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:02.960
Aichi...

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:05.280
I can't fight you.

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:08.690
See you.

00:21:15.510 --> 00:21:16.790
Hey, Kai!

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:20.240
I'm dropping out of Team Q4.

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:23.260
What?! What are you talking about?!

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:30.960
Did I make...

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:34.060
the same mistake?!

00:21:42.640 --> 00:21:43.710
Kai...

00:21:45.560 --> 00:21:48.320
Here, take this.

00:21:51.020 --> 00:21:54.040
Imagining things will become your power!

00:22:02.270 --> 00:22:04.670
Yeah, that card is yours after all.

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:09.150
Thank you...

00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:12.550
Why...?

00:23:51.490 --> 00:23:53.720
So we made it past the preliminaries 
without any trouble, huh?

00:23:53.720 --> 00:23:57.910
I caused the team a lot of problems last 
time, so now I've gotta do my best!

00:23:57.910 --> 00:24:02.860
But what's with Kai, saying he's dropping 
out of the team after all this?!

00:24:02.860 --> 00:24:04.420
Kai, why?

00:24:04.420 --> 00:24:06.620
We're strong even without that guy,

00:24:06.620 --> 00:24:08.140
so it's absolutely no problem!

00:24:08.140 --> 00:24:09.350
Right...

00:24:09.350 --> 00:24:11.670
Next time: The Black Vanguard!

00:24:11.670 --> 00:24:13.230
We've gotten stronger.

00:24:13.230 --> 00:24:15.730
The images become power 
and well up within me!

00:24:16.480 --> 00:24:18.210
Ren... and me?
